From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 20:08:08 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 38/41] Plutonium: usage-limit warnings in
 orchestrator_capabilities

Agents choosing a provider instance for a new thread or child task couldn't
see which ones were close to their limits. Each instance now has a
usageWarning when a subscription window is at 80% or more:
{level: near_limit | at_limit, window, usedPercent, resetsAt, message}, for
the window closest to its limit (at the limit, the one that frees last). A
window past its reset time has reset. Not the usage data the UI draws.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
